al":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CU/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ea0ac9d0-bbed-4761-944a-5597267c51f4","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"GHA でプロセスリストが盗み見られる可能性まで考えてたらさすがになんもできない気がしてきたのでコマンドライン上に直接 secrets 展開でもいい気もしてくる","ts":"1621266124.112900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Li1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a4f16c42-38fb-41ca-9601-ac57ca7ee093","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"まあ env に入れても `$FOO` をコマンドラインに渡したらプロセスリストには環境変数展開後のコマンドが出るんですけどね…シェルが展開するので","ts":"1621266063.112100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mzs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e89a8baa-6c42-49ad-85a0-2aa431042b55","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"雑に全体スコープの `env:` に入れるのはやめましょうってことかな","ts":"1621266008.111500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Y=kK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a3a8d7ea-2bdb-45c9-b32d-8323e3a56058","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"なるほど `run:` で使うならそのブロックオンリーの `env:` に入れるのがいいんでしょうね。","ts":"1621265980.110700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"n8pI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"58248b59-03c6-4437-a80f-77b6a2e62920","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"GHA で気にする必要があるかわからないけど、コマンドライン引数はプロセスリストに出るのでコマンドラインに直接秘匿情報を渡さない方がいい、みたいな話もありますよね","ts":"1621265882.109300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dsy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e3b7cd38-6b86-47b3-addf-5e0fa773b11f","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"secrets を action に渡す時は常に必要最低限にするほうがよいのでは？","ts":"1621265834.108500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zIG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1f53ddf0-8695-4fcb-9c83-1a9f0986a126","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"セキュリティなんもわからんってなるよな","ts":"1621265762.107200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5IlL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3834fdb5-2ae7-4817-b754-0d15571289ea","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"入れない方がよい、雑に利用した外部actionに攻撃コードが入ってると困るから\nという話だったような","ts":"1621265711.107000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4s06"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d6bb2e01-9a26-433a-a741-5c3b6e9f8862","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"うーん、調べてもわからない。記憶違いだったかな…","ts":"1621265466.105800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XgZz/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7c81b81f-3511-4a05-ae30-310bbe27ad3f","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"GitHub Actions 上で secrets を扱う際、secrets を環境変数に入れた方がよいとか逆に入れない方がよいとかってありましたっけ。何かで聞いた気がするのだけど思い出せない","ts":"1621264743.103900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PElw"}]}]
